      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Unfortunately there is so much misinformation and Clickbait Marketing out there that it's so hard to make a decision on who to even talk too, let alone get to Install.We had three quotes when I put my details down and all the same very pushy, talking so much about why their own products were the best, and unfortunately only one of the sales reps asked if I had any thoughts on what I would like installed on the house.The team at freedom Solar we're not pushy, they explain that their new Solar and Battery plan use specific products but once I googled them I had no issues at all about putting them on my roof and on the wall.Their plan is absolutely fantastic and it's nice not to be forced to try and pay cash or long-term finance. I think the hardest battle for them was trying to explain to me how it's not \"too good to be true\"The system is fully installed now and the monitoring is fantastic, it's so nice having Battery storage, but it's even better keeping all my money in my pocket that others were pushing hard for me to spend, especially towards the end of financial year.",
